    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "# Vectors & lists\n![](/images/Rvector.png){style=\"width:300px; background: white; border-radius: 5px; border: 5px white solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nA __R object__ can hold multiple values.\nMany <u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__data structures__</u> can do this with the simplest being a <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vector__</u>.\n\nA <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vector__</u> can be created with the `c()` <u id='function_tooltip'>__function__</u>. \nThis function will combine the provided objects into a single <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vector__</u> or __list__.\n\n<u id='vector_tooltip'>__Vectors__</u> and __lists__ are both 1-dimensional <u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__data structures__</u>. \n<u id='vector_tooltip'>__Vectors__</u> can only contain one <u id='class_tooltip'>__class__</u> (homogeneous) whilst __lists__ can contain multiple (heterogeneous). \nThere is more to __lists__ but we will not go into them.\n\n## Creating vector variables\n\nRun the following commands to produce <u id='variable_tooltip'>__variables__</u> which contain <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vectors__</u>.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nnumber_vec <- c(1,2,4,8,16)\nnumber_vec\nnumber_series_vec <- 1:6\nnumber_series_vec\nanimals <- c(\"Whale\",\"Seal\",\"Hedgehog\",\"Mouse\",\"Owl\",\"Squirrel\",\"Vole\",\"Shrew\")\nanimals\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Elements and indices\n\nElements of a <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vector__</u> can be accessed through their indices:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nbirds <- animals[5]\nbirds\naquatic <- animals[1:2]\naquatic\nrodents <- animals[c(4,6,7)]\nrodents\nmammals <- animals[-5]\nmammals\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Operators & functions\n\nYou can use <u id='operator_tooltip'>__operators__</u> and <u id='function_tooltip'>__functions__</u> on a <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vector__</u>. \nWhen you do each <u id='scalar_tooltip'>__scalar__</u> within the <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vector__</u> will be acted upon.\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nnumber_vec - 1\nnumber_vec * 2\nlog(number_vec)\nlength(rodents)\n```\n:::\n\n\nSome <u id='function_tooltip'>__functions__</u> are specifically used for <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vectors__</u>:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmean(number_vec)\nsummary(number_vec)\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Comparisons\n\nWe can also test the values within <u id='vector_tooltip'>__vectors__</u>:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\naquatic == \"Whale\"\nnumber_vec > 4\nnumber_vec[number_vec > 4]\n```\n:::\n\n\n## paste()\n\nThe `paste()` <u id='function_tooltip'>__function__</u> can be used to paste __<u id='string_tooltip'>string</u> <u id='scalar_tooltip'>scalars</u>__ to other __<u id='string_tooltip'>string</u> <u id='scalar_tooltip'>scalars</u>__ or to __<u id='string_tooltip'>string</u> <u id='vector_tooltip'>vectors</u>__:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\npaste(\"Animals\", animals)\nbird_or_mammal <- c(\"mammal\",\"mammal\",\"mammal\",\"mammal\",\"bird\",\"mammal\",\"mammal\",\"mammal\")\npaste(animals, bird_or_mammal, sep = \":\")\npaste(animals, \" is a \", bird_or_mammal, sep = \"\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b6a384f1870814c422ec\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b6a384f1870814c422ec\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-824c1da198ac478a5f53\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-824c1da198ac478a5f53\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-c463cc26c54f646b5e83\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-c463cc26c54f646b5e83\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8739243880623d16d8ce\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8739243880623d16d8ce\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-5a5424756825923b4cdf\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5a5424756825923b4cdf\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-aeb9242277d66c0a819b\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-aeb9242277d66c0a819b\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-fe39d84eeb05579948a9\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-fe39d84eeb05579948a9\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-2a761cd48ba990349e8a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2a761cd48ba990349e8a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1fa9355efca5abdbddb1\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1fa9355efca5abdbddb1\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-37fa54258657275cd582\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-37fa54258657275cd582\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a87b6698006f757eaeef\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a87b6698006f757eaeef\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-556af90e311a0920e547\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-556af90e311a0920e547\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b9d0e348b2a161771545\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b9d0e348b2a161771545\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
